_:cb197d63efd5d86d77353d1141eb21517c8e3a71486640ab8c115288ad948346123 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A FollowUpVisit should declare cr:followUpType (safety | efficacy | qol)." .
_:cb197d63efd5d86d77353d1141eb21517c8e3a71486640ab8c115288ad948346123 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb197d63efd5d86d77353d1141eb21517c8e3a71486640ab8c115288ad948346123 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#followUpType> .
_:cb197d63efd5d86d77353d1141eb21517c8e3a71486640ab8c115288ad948346123 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
_:cb1986fe821749b81f255c92935f1e014e23ed9f2cf5a858f448f26d4a4158f29da <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "definite" .
_:cb1986fe821749b81f255c92935f1e014e23ed9f2cf5a858f448f26d4a4158f29da <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
