_:cb19c606734300bc9522eea904839da358903257c9fe5e22dfefeca19571c8ad1d4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "cx:Mapping has cx:inferredBy but cx:mappingMethod is not 'LLMInference'. Set mappingMethod to document provenance correctly." .
_:cb19c606734300bc9522eea904839da358903257c9fe5e22dfefeca19571c8ad1d4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this <https://top.scientix.ai/crosswalk/v1#inferredBy> ?agent .\n              FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n                $this <https://top.scientix.ai/crosswalk/v1#mappingMethod> \"LLMInference\" .\n              }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb19cd5574ee6c08e6358e4a4ea7f47238b13dd2beb97a82c2a75c7dd9ef42c87f3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "DataElementSpecification value range is inverted (cr:valueRangeLow > cr:valueRangeHigh)." .
_:cb19cd5574ee6c08e6358e4a4ea7f47238b13dd2beb97a82c2a75c7dd9ef42c87f3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#> .
_:cb19cd5574ee6c08e6358e4a4ea7f47238b13dd2beb97a82c2a75c7dd9ef42c87f3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this cr:valueRangeLow ?lo ; cr:valueRangeHigh ?hi .\n              FILTER ( ?lo > ?hi )\n            }\n        " .
_:cb19d0e03ffe2a52cfb5a8e39246b8eba83ad440589082fa8cf6ef70d4be651981e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A DataElementSpecification with no bound BiomedicalConcept is non-conformant: the SDTM target is a projection of the concept binding, so an unbound element can never be rendered." .
_:cb19d0e03ffe2a52cfb5a8e39246b8eba83ad440589082fa8cf6ef70d4be651981e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
