_:cb1fd32da1b2cc7ab7d98ab20bb874e10b1d01de3121b2b67b553136d1eb3207996 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "cr:datasetStructure, when declared, must be ADSL, BDS, or OCCDS (CDISC ADaM structure classes)." .
_:cb1fd32da1b2cc7ab7d98ab20bb874e10b1d01de3121b2b67b553136d1eb3207996 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#datasetStructure> .
